flowchart LR
    subgraph Windows Host
      DEVICES[Endpoints de áudio\nUSB · Conference Cam · Bluetooth]
      CAP[Windows Audio Agent\nPerfis + WASAPI]
      UI[Web Console]
    end

    subgraph WSL2 Development
      IDE[VS Code WSL + Claude Code]
      REPO[Git workspace\nJava + Python + docs]
    end

    subgraph Docker / WSL2 Runtime
      STT[Transcription Service\nFastAPI + faster-whisper]
      CORE[Session Core\nJava 21 + Spring Boot]
      DB[(Session Store futuro)]
    end

    DEVICES -- fluxos independentes --> CAP
    CAP -- PCM 16 kHz\nWebSocket por channelId --> STT
    STT -- eventos v2 por canal --> UI
    IDE --> REPO
    REPO -. build / compose .-> STT
    REPO -. build / compose .-> CORE
    STT -. próximo incremento .-> CORE
    CORE --> DB
    CORE -. plugin SPI .-> PLUGINS[Plugins de IA, memória,\nanálise e captura visual]
